+ at certainly is, except perhaps in the case of ‘ Monna Vanna’, not in the matter of the plays to which he has refused a licence, but in regard to a few of the plays which he sanctioned./France is now going through a similar experience with regard to Morocco to that which England had to undergo with reference to Egypt after the occupation.
