<<<
concern. In (so far) as concerns or regards, the number of the verb (which is impersonal, or has for its unexpressed subject ‘ our inquiry ’ or some similar phrase) is invariable; the change to plural, as in the quotation that follows, is due, like as FOLLOW, to misapprehension:— Many of these stalks were failures, so far as concern the objective success.
===
**concern.** In (*so far*) *as concerns* or *regards*, the number of the verb (which is impersonal, or has for its unexpressed subject ' *our inquiry* ' or some similar phrase) is invariable; the change to plural, as in the quotation that follows, is due, like *as* ^^FOLLOW^^, to misapprehension:—*Many of these stalks were failures, so far as* concern *the objective success.*
>>>

